OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA very wet day to come on
OL,6,FTuesday, with heavy and persistent
OL,7,Frain at times and some early morning
OL,8,Fsnow over the hills. Strong winds
OL,9,Ftowards the coast and over high
OL,10,Fground, easing later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain continuing through this
OL,13,Fevening and overnight with some brief
OL,14,Fdrier interludes further south. Winds
OL,15,Feasing and a milder night than recent
OL,16,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
