OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with further spells
OL,6,Fof rain on Wednesday, heavy at times
OL,7,Fover the hills. Some drier and
OL,8,Fpossibly brighter interludes in the
OL,9,Fsouth. Feeling chilly in the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FShowery outbreaks of rain clearing
OL,13,Fthrough Thursday. Turning drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter on Friday and into Saturday.
OL,15,FTemperatures below average with frost
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
